<item><title>Dfcu Bank offers up to Shs40,000 cashback on VISA spending</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/dfcu-bank-offers-up-to-shs40-000-cashback-on-visa-spending-438455/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/dfcu-bank-offers-up-to-shs40-000-cashback-on-visa-spending-438455/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>Cardholders can earn up to 8% back on eligible purchases, and discounts of up to 20% apply to flights and online shopping until December 31, 2026.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:59:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
